{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_bibeak_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_bibeak_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "破壳",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bibeak_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "52adc0cc7acbd54b6555125f8376a091840ff4c4630e812a3d6953d099f89720",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "梓兰姐......我、我还是有些紧张。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "大家都有第一次出任务的时候，不用这么担心啦，有我在的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "而且你这几天都泡在训练室里，你现在的剑术并不比谁差，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "钳兽......是很凶猛的东西吧？如果村子里的人们都无法赶走它们，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我不否认钳兽的凶猛程度，但我敢打包票，如果拿钳兽和坚雷教官的剑盾、杜宾教官的鞭子比，它们可能还真的比不上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "你能得到几位教官的认可，被分配到这项外勤任务，就说明你的能力足以承担起它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "这只是一个开端，你不是也下了很久决心才决定报名的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "呼——梓兰姐，原来坐在这辆车上是这种感觉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "刚才办事处的干员来找我们的时候，我还在想，要不还是等下次机会吧，但自己还是想要迈出这一步，就这么把手举起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "好久没看到杜宾教官看着我笑了，我一定要好好地完成这次任务。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "这把佩剑......我希望它和我都能保护更多的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "这才对嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "那，梓兰姐，能和我说说你第一次出任务的情形吗？我想听听梓兰姐的经验。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "唔，那是好久之前了。好像是我带着小队出去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "那次任务结束后，我差点萌生了辞职的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "还好，他们后来渐渐地开始听话了......可能吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "......原来几位前辈是这样的性格......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "那个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "你们是罗德岛派来的人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "对......我们是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "柏喙，你来和他们讲一下我们的任务细节怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "您好，我们是罗德岛负责这次任务的小队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "这次任务我们会先在村子外布置上防御工事，等结束后我们也会教给你们它的制造和布置方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "防御工事上还有相应的感应报警装置，这样就算以后再有钳兽来袭，你们也可以提前做准备，村庄不至于会损失惨重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "等钳兽来了，我们会帮你们击退它们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "嗯嗯，那......我还有点问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "嗯？您请说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "小姑娘，你说话慢慢的，佩剑也细细的，罗德岛为什么派了你这样的人来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "你真的能打退钳兽吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "请您说话——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我可以的，请您相信我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "嗨......我说话直，别介意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "像您这样有气质的小姐，我以为只会待在家里看书喝茶，哪做得了这种粗活，别到时候反而伤了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "能来这里帮我们，我们感激还来不及。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "来吧来吧，我屋子里准备了茶和点心——村子里自己做的，别嫌弃就好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "谢谢您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "茶很好喝，谢谢您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "嗨，自家种了点，这些都已经是去年的了。今年的茶田被钳兽糟蹋，剩下的那点也根本种不了多少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "日子难啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "您没有想过离开这里，做点别的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "能去哪呢，小姑娘？没那么容易啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "工厂如今也要那些有学识的，我们这种，就守着这块地，看看自己的子辈能做点什么吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "抱歉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "没什么。看几位衣着都是有气质的，是公子小姐闲了，来我们这里磨炼磨炼的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "我们也想着，几位要是有什么可以挣稳定工资的门路，也千万拜托给我们讲讲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "我看我们这里的情况，总觉得撑不了几年......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我们并不是什么有钱人家的子弟，也不过是在公司里谋生活罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "但您要是真的有什么困难，可以在结束后我们一起详聊一下。或许我们能提供一定程度的帮助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "哎，谢谢，太谢谢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "喂！喂！！望风的人看到钳兽过来了！大家都拿上东西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "走，走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "几位，我再多嘴一句，村子经不起再被它们糟蹋一波了，拜托几位一定要帮我们赶走它们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "我们真的十分感谢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "大家......请尽量站在高处！下面有我们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "小姑娘，不用那么担心，我们和它们打过很多次了，多少有点经验！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "我们这些人可以帮你们几个守住这边！虽然比不上你们，但能分担一点还是好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "拜托你们了！你们只要守住这里的防御工事就好，但千万小心别被上面的法术误伤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "法术？你们还会法术啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "真是捡到宝了，我听说外面厉害的术师一个人就能炸翻一栋楼，有你们在，我们这不是轻轻松松！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "大哥，别太乐观，我没有那么厉害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "会法术对我们来说就很厉害了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "小心点，怀特，帕迪，启动盾牌上的源石回路！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A&B",
      "text": "收到！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "嚯！看起来真带劲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "这东西你们真的可以留给我们？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "留一些工事远比我们次次派人来援助要省时省力得多，你们学会了，也就不需要我们经常来帮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "好事嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "你们可真是好人啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "......啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "梓兰姐小心，它们已经凑过来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "伤到哪了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "肩膀被划到了，没事......我可以处理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "柏喙用被撕碎的布料简单地包扎住伤口，露出了原本被作战服包裹住的脖子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "嗯......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "（你......你看她脖子上，是源石吗？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "（什么？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "（*粗口*！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "喂，你、你们是......感染者吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "还真是！你身上那些，就是石头吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "我、我——我拜托你们，走远些！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "你说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "你们真是感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "该死的，那我们刚才还在一起喝了茶！我会不会——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "钳兽、钳兽——这群钳兽为什么只过来打我们，你们倒是把感染者打出去啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一位村民从家中拿出了气味浓郁的食物，丢向小队所在的位置。\n钳兽循着气味爬了过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "去咬他们啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "我——我宁愿被钳兽吃光家里的东西，也不想得这病！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "你们是怎么来到这里的？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "是你们请——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "我们没请感染者来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "可我们不是在帮你们吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "你刚刚还请我们去你家里......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "——那是因为我不知道你们是感染者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "你骗了我们！你们把身上的源石藏得严严实实，谁能看得出来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "你们说什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "走啊！你们走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "钳兽，赶走他们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "你们现在突然说这些？！矿石病并不会通过日常接触传播！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "我不是感染者，我和他们一起工作好几年了，我一点事都没有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "你不是感染者？你更是个疯子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "比尔就是不知怎么就得了这种病，长了石头以后就没地方留他做活，最苦的底层矿厂都不愿意收他，他没处去，就这么死了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "他死之后还、还......我们村子就是因为感染者完蛋的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "你们居然敢大摇大摆地就这么直接进我们村子？你是不是想让我们都得病死掉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "你们是来帮我们的，还是来害我们的？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "出去！你们都出去！我们不需要你们来帮我们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员B",
      "text": "梓兰姐，你是队长，下令吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员B",
      "text": "我是忍不了了！在这里平白挨骂是为什么，居然还把钳兽往我们这里引！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "柏喙，打退这一只，我们就走吧。他们做出了这样的决定，我们也没有必要硬留在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我从高处往下撤，你从防御工事后绕路，我们在车子旁边会合！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我们为什么要离开，以一种被赶走的方式......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "......我们没有做错什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我们明明是来——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "另一块带有浓郁气味的食物砸了过来，落在柏喙脚边。周围的钳兽嗅到了香气，掉转方向向她爬来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "梓兰用源石技艺勉强击退柏喙四周的钳兽，让它们一时不敢再靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "柏喙，这种事情我遇到过几次。很多人可能根本没有仔细阅读罗德岛的支援说明，只是想得到一些帮助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "但现在这种情况对我们十分不利，我们在这里继续待下去，可能还会引起他们的愤怒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "万一有人做出什么过激行为只会更糟糕，我建议我们撤退！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......你是担心任务失败吗，柏喙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我、我不知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "梓兰姐，这是我第一次外勤任务，我不想就这么放弃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "而且——我们并没有做错什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我不能理解，我帮了他们，却要被他们赶走吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我......我之前看到钳兽就会害怕地躲到父母身后，看到伤害自己的人就只想我应该怎么办......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "但我......我，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我不想走！我不想就这样......被赶走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "钳兽不再惧怕梓兰释放出的源石技艺，试探性地迈出了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "柏喙挥下一剑。\n她想斩断什么——她曾面对愤怒的人群保护身后的人，也曾在训练场里挥下无数剑。\n但今天这剑她只是想为了自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "你们这样做，就因为我是感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "......难道我是感染者，我就比那些会撕碎你们住处的钳兽更可恶、更可怕，值得你们退开这么远的距离吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "即便我们已经说了，我们......并不会把矿石病传染给你们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "村民们没有人回答。\n钳兽仿佛没有尽头一般，冲破了村庄前的防御工事。\n柏喙没有挪动双腿，她只是站在这里，拿着她那柄细细的剑，抬手，挥下，咬紧牙关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "（......还是个倔丫头。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "（这是把这次任务看成对自己的一个证明了......其实可以不用这样委屈自己的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "（但你要这么想的话......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "柏喙，你要真的想这么做，我来帮你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......但不要这么拼，你已经受伤了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "该死的，钳兽要冲进来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "别再后退了，我们必须要在这里把钳兽拦住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "家里有弩的，有工具的，都别在后面躲着了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "门窗锁紧，再确认一遍自己的锁牢不牢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "越来越多的钳兽涌向村庄，数量远超了人们一开始的估计。\n一个接着一个的村民走出房门，站到了前面来。\n已经回撤的几位干员看着沉默不语只是挥剑的柏喙，大叹一口气，重新拿起了扔在脚边的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员B",
      "text": "......*粗话*算了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员B",
      "text": "梓兰姐，我和帕迪去重新加固一下防御工事，要不然这样下去大伙都玩完！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "我、我......你们别过来——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "——我的腿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "受伤了就退下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "你、你别过来......！我自己站起来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "嘁，我也没想着扶你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "防御工事立起来了！梓兰姐，柏喙，躲过来些！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "这东西没完没了，我就不信了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "......你的身后！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "多谢兄弟！呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "别说废话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "总之多谢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "别光站着，做点事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员B",
      "text": "光看着我们干嘛？嘴上说着爱村子，现在就看着他们几个感染者在前面打？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员B",
      "text": "我再说一遍，只是一般的接触不会造成感染！你们要是真的想把钳兽赶走，就站到前面来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "我、我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "*粗话*，我豁出去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "给你这个！但、但你就站在那别过来......我扔给你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员B",
      "text": "别磨磨叽叽的，你要真怕可以不给，我又没逼你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "我就是怕，我就是怕！但我......我得有点良心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "你们救了我，我起码心里得对得起我自己！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "这是我们自己做的气味包，里面的味道钳兽不喜欢，能顶点用！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "给——接着！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "怀特，你注意着点那边......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊恐的声音",
      "text": "啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一声尖叫让所有人都转过了头，一个小女孩指着柏喙所在的方向，惊恐无比。\n柏喙身后，一只钳兽已经举起了利爪，柏喙试图举起剑，但似乎是由于疲劳，没有成功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一只弩箭穿透了钳兽的身躯，在它的爪钳即将刺向柏喙的身体时。\n持弩的村民伸手护住自己惊恐的女儿，没有说什么，她只是在下一瞬继续看向新的一只钳兽，拉满了弦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "柏喙！你没事吧？！你先退到后面休——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "梓兰姐，没事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "后面，后面又冲过来了啊啊啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "别再乱喊了！有时间过来把工事撑住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "来、来了！嗯......我不怕！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "还有力气的，过来帮帮他们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民C",
      "text": "还有囤的那些土炮都拿上来，多少起点作用！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "从下午到傍晚，愚钝的钳兽似乎意识到了前方为死路，它们并不应该继续前行，逐渐退去。\n人们停下发酸的手，怔怔地站在原地，还没有从上一刻的拼杀中回过神来。\n柏喙把剑拄在地上，用它支撑着身体，随后转过身，走向罗德岛停在远处的车。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "柏喙！走，快回车上，我给你处理伤口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "村民们站在原地，有的人踌躇着想迈出一步，但最终停了下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛外勤干员A",
      "text": "......哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "我觉得我们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "那个，那个，几位......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "抱歉......也谢谢你们。我们家里还有之前准备的饭，天也晚了，我给你们拿上，路上吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民B",
      "text": "......真的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "不用了，就到这里吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "梓兰姐，我想吃你做的那个点心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "你是不是带了一点来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "嗯，带了，就在车上放着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "我们走吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "好了，我给你包扎好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "呜呜呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "忍得很辛苦吧？哭出来了就好，哭出来了就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "但你已经很勇敢了，对不对？你不是一开始就哭着跑回车上，而是击退了所有钳兽，自己走回来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "是你让那些村民渐渐改变了想法，和我们一起作战的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "不然以我们其他人的决定，大家只会立马转身离开，回去的时候骂一路解气，什么都不会改变。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "梓兰姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我无数次地告诉我自己，我不能沉浸在怨恨里，我不能让我自己变成一副可怕的样子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "但在别人眼中，在那些没有染病的普通人眼里，我就是一副可怕的样子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "可是......可是，我觉得，他们其实......没有错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "柏喙，你......可以不用这样安慰自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "罗德岛的支援说明上写了我们的小队成员包含感染者，是他们没有看。起码，他们可以用一种更体面的方式，我们不是不能接受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "......梓兰姐，我是真心这样觉得，他们的害怕理所应当，因为我也害怕，我也怨恨，我很恐惧我的病。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我离开了我的宅子，来这里抑制我的病情，又参加了那么多次的训练，得到了这样一个机会，我能战胜我的恐惧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "也许其他人不一定能吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "但我不想我做了这么多，却在第一次外勤任务就停下来，甚至再退回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "......但我是不是有些自私了？如果他们真的很恐惧，我不应该......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "柏喙，躺下歇歇吧，先不要想那么多了，吃点东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "他们因为不了解矿石病才感到恐惧，但我们说明了仅仅是一般的接触并不会造成感染。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "后面他们冷静下来，也接受了这个事实。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "那他们下回还会请求罗德岛的帮助吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "或者，下回他们仍旧选择了求助罗德岛......我还会愿意接下任务吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "这就看你自己的选择了，柏喙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "每个人都有自己的选择。比如我，我可能会犹豫很久......然后再拒绝吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "......我现在还不知道我以后的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "有可能下一次他们就不再惧怕我们了，也有可能下一次他们仍旧排斥，或者根本就不会有下一次......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "但我会等着那样一天的到来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "（递上了点心）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "梓兰姐，谢谢你今天陪我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "不然，我可能会做傻事吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "但我......不后悔申请参加这次外勤任务，即便它和我想象的很不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我会继续坚持下去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
